{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/glyph.png?t=1744211828\" />\u00a0<strong>GLYPHS</strong> is a difficult puzzle-platformer about exploration and persistence.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/glyph.png?t=1744211828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the depths of the Tomb of Forbidden Knowledge; a sentient labyrinth containing traces of the past in the form of glyphs. Formidable bosses, platforming, and puzzles stand in the way of discovery, as GLYPHS fulfills the extent that one willingly searches for true knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the hundreds of rooms to explore, there are many puzzles and deep secrets that surround the overarching story of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses and trials serve to award you new platforming abilities and knowledge to help you uncover further areas of the tomb, and find puzzles hidden in explored areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The well is much deeper than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616230?t=1744211828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/e6bc6dd208ae9ae3ae815dfc2d7d356afb4a2e2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744211828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/3428681ddbc63a0c11d02a9cb6308b7fc01bd76b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744211828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/3428681ddbc63a0c11d02a9cb6308b7fc01bd76b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744211828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/glyph.png?t=1744211828\" />\u00a0<strong>GLYPHS</strong> is a difficult puzzle-platformer about exploration and persistence.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/glyph.png?t=1744211828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the depths of the Tomb of Forbidden Knowledge; a sentient labyrinth containing traces of the past in the form of glyphs. Formidable bosses, platforming, and puzzles stand in the way of discovery, as GLYPHS fulfills the extent that one willingly searches for true knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the hundreds of rooms to explore, there are many puzzles and deep secrets that surround the overarching story of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses and trials serve to award you new platforming abilities and knowledge to help you uncover further areas of the tomb, and find puzzles hidden in explored areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The well is much deeper than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Landon Chandler"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/c57c6d1b95e994a823776c3660e7a3c1487ee91d/header.jpg?t=1744211828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123184,